    Changes: council-controlled electricity, gas and water rows only (the council's Electricity, Gas and Water
    categories; Green Power, cogeneration, solar, reclaimed water and waste water left out); the 60 assets that use 90%
    of each measure in the financial year kept; bills spread evenly over their days, both ends counted, and kept to
    1 July 2013 to 30 June 2014; shapes picked from the footprints and property boundaries or drawn along the road
    corridors in Plotlay; floors joined from the CLUE 2014 record inside each footprint (or in the same parcel).

